 * Easy to mock for testing:
 * ```kotlin
 * class Fake{{ service_name }}Service : {{ service_name }}Service {
 *     var shouldFail = false
 *
 *     override suspend fun fetch() = if (shouldFail) {
 *         Result.failure(NetworkError())
